v2engine (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial production release.
  * Add VLESS, Reality, VMess, Trojan, Shadowsocks, and SSH support.
  * Add system TUN mode, direct-domain routing, and proxy latency tests.
  * Add the compact charcoal and emerald GTK interface.
  * Add a native Linux status notifier menu and custom window controls.
  * Add GitHub Release update checks and verified in-app package installation.
  * Verify TUN connectivity before reporting success and show live traffic data.
  * Add in-window Direct Sites and Settings pages with desktop startup support.
  * Make Test All perform direct, real proxied HTTPS checks.
  * Fix legacy TCP HTTP-header camouflage connections and zero-millisecond
    results.
  * Reduce the package size with a minimal, reproducible sing-box build.
  * Add persistent and multi-server clipboard import controls.
  * Apply transport, TLS, DNS bootstrap, and TUN bypass settings automatically.

 -- Ali Ranjbar <info@aliranjbar.me>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0400
